    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that sounds good for the report. some of the neighbors are really pushing back though, saying it's going to ruin the character of the neighborhood and basically kill the vibe of the area. how should i address those concerns in my briefing? should i just frame them as typical opposition to progress or is there a better way to handle it?",
